    <description>DIR-1128: On QuoteLineItem create, enforces one product per Quote and quantity of 1 (both errors surface together), then on a valid single line updates the Opportunity stage. Before each block it publishes RES_Line_Item_Alert__e (publish-immediately) so the user gets a real-time bell even from Browse Catalogs, which swallows save-time error messages. Opportunity-stage logic is unchanged.</description>
